 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Finite pushforwards of constant sheaves",
 "statement": "Let $g:V\\to S$ be finite\nwith $S$ of finite type over $k$, and let $M$ be a finite abelian\ngroup. Then $g_*\\underline M$ is\nconstructible on\n$S_{{\\mathrm{et}}}$.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-smooth-purity/sk-prop-a1-kummer/lem-fin-finite-constant-pushforward.md",
